eenshots.\n\nBuild calls plan:\n1. Inspection (read-only).\n2. Setup: rename page? No. Create component set area: my button components, ViewSwitcher variants, ChatListItem variants, ExportRow, ImageTile, SuggestionCard, SettingsRow, MessageBubbles, MessageActions(?). That's a big call; split:\n   Call A: helpers? Can't persist. \n   Call 2: foundations — my buttons (secondary, destructive), ViewSwitcher component set, Input filled field component, SearchField component.\n   Call 3: list components — ChatListItem (default + with image), ExportRow, ImageTile, SuggestionCard.\n   Call 4: message components — UserBubble, AI bubble text, AI bubble image, SettingsRow, StorageBar.\n   Call 5: build 01_Login + 02_Home_Chats (frames, status bar instances, content).\n   Call 6: build 03 + 04.\n   Call 7: build 05 + 06.\n   Call 8: build 07 (clone 06 + sheet).\n   Call 9: build 08.\n   Call 10: build 09, 10 (clone 08 + sheets).\n   Call 11: build 11.\n   Call 12: build 12 (clone 11 + dialog).\n   Call 13: prototype reactions all frames.\n   Call 14+: screenshots & fixes.\n\nEach call: heavy code. Let me be careful with font loading per call: load all fonts used in that call: Bricolage Grotesque (styles? need to check availability: probably Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Bold, ExtraBold), Nunito (Regular, SemiBold, Bold, ExtraBold, Italic?).\n\nNunito \"SemiBold\" vs \"Semi Bold\"? For Nunito, Google font styles: \"Regular\", \"Italic\", \"SemiBold\"? Figma lists Nunito styles as \"Regular\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\",\"ExtraBold\",\"Black\", etc. (no space). Bricolage Grotesque: \"Regular\",\"Medium\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\",\"ExtraBold\". The gotcha about \"Semi Bold\" applies to Inter specifically. I'll confirm via listAvailableFontsAsync.\n\nText width handling: set textAutoResize \"HEIGHT\" with fixed width for wrapping; or \"WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT\" for single line. For truncation with ellipsis: set textTruncation = \"ENDING\", maxLines. Figma Plugin API: TextNode.textTruncation (\"DISABL