ow bubble (outside, under bubble, left aligned): 20 high + 4 gap. y 217..370.\n- Msg3 user: 130 chars → 3 lines? width 280: ~2.5 → 3 lines 63+24=87. y 380..467.\n- Msg4 AI: text 2 lines 42+24=66; image: width 260 → h= 260*200/281 = 185; radius 14; actions 24. Total 66+8+185+6+24 = 289 → y 477..766.\n- Input bar y≈800: 48 high + send. Ends 848 ≤ 894 ✓. \n\nStory truncation: 5 lines at ~48 chars/line ≈ 240 chars: \"Once upon a time, in the quaint town of Meadowville, there lived a spirited high school student named Lily. Lily was known for her enthusiasm for learning and her adventurous spirit. One crisp autumn morning, as she set out for school, little did she know that this ordinary day would turn into an extraordinary adventure. As Lily walked down the familiar path…\" — I'll use first 2 paragraphs + \"…\" via textTruncation maxLines 5 (auto ellipsis). Good: set full-ish text (first ~2 paragraphs) with maxLines=5.\n\n07 sheet: clone 06 → dim → sheet y=428, height 500: content: grabber 36×4; header row: \"Export as PDF\" Bricolage SemiBold 22 + close button (Icon_Close in circle bg fieldBg 36); PDF icon 48 + copy text (13/18 sub, width 330); \"Title\" label Nunito SemiBold 13 sub; Text Field instance filled \"The story of a student\" (dark text); Export Button instance (380). Links: close → 06; Export → 06; dim → 06.\n\n08_Profile_Settings:\n- Status bar; header row y=51: back 22 (→02), \"Profile & Settings\"? Title in header center? Design: header row [back] [Profile & Settings Bricolage SemiBold 20 center] [more 22]. Then profile block: avatar 84 centered y≈110; name centered Bricolage SemiBold 24 y≈205; premium badge pill centered (tint bg: Icon_Premium 14 + \"premium account\" 12 SemiBold primary); caption \"278 days until the end of the premium account\" 13 sub centered.\n- Settings card (bg surface radius 16, rows 56 with dividers):\n  - Email: Icon_Email, \"Email\", value \"sam.rivera@example.com\" (12.5 sub), chevron\n  - Change password: Icon_Password, \"Ch