{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design in an assigned Figma file for a benchmark (unattended session):\n   - File: https://www.figma.com/design/S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU/ (fileKey S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU). Use ONLY this file. Account verified: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (whoami ✓ done).\n   - Build complete design inside page 5:2 \"03 · Workspace\" (was empty). Preserve all reference pages (0:1, 1:2, 1:3, 1:4). Do not create other files or switch accounts.\n   - Product: \"Chat Bot AI — AI assistant app\". 12 frames with EXACT names: 01_Login, 02_Home_Chats, 03_Home_Images, 04_Home_Exports, 05_Chat_New, 06_Chat_Conversation, 07_Export_PDF_Sheet, 08_Profile_Settings, 09_Account_Actions_Sheet, 10_Theme_Sheet, 11_Cloud_Space, 12_Clear_Cache_Dialog. Canvas 428×928, light mode only. Do not add frames beyond the 12.\n   - Fonts: Bricolage Grotesque (titles/display) + Nunito (body). Brand primary #612A74. Reuse components from 02 (Button 3:24, Text Field 3:29, Status Bar 3:34, Home Indicator 3:45) and media from 04.\n   - Prototype: wire the listed links with CLICK → NAVIGATE reactions.\n   - PROCESS RULES (verbatim-critical): Before EVERY tool call include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\" in the same assistant message. After each tool result, same before next call. Final response: \"Reasoning summary: ...\" on first line, then \"Final answer:\" and the answer. Inspect screenshots of all 12 screens, fix visible problems, re-verify. Finish with: assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations. Do not claim completion for unfinished work.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (each call = independent sandbox; must re-load fonts and re-fetch nodes every call; code ≤50,000 chars)\n   - `await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)`, `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`\n   - CRITICAL ORDERING RULE: set `layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\"` only AFTER appending child to its auto-layout parent\n   - `cornerRadius` takes a NUMBER only; per-corner via topLeftRadius/topRightRadius etc.\n   - H()/V()/HH() helper signature: H(name,h,gap,fill,pad,r) — gap is 3rd arg, fill 4th; HH hugs both axes\n   - Component instances: createInstance(), child overrides via findOne(n=>n.name===\"...\") (characters, fills, visible), `instance.swapComponent(componentNode)` for icon swaps, `instance.rescale(scale)`, setProperties({\"Label#3:0\":\"Export\"})\n   - Overlay pattern: clone finished parent frame → append dim rect (black 45%, name \"dim\") → sheet/dialog on top\n   - Image fills: {type:\"IMAGE\", scaleMode:\"FILL\", imageHash}\n   - Prototype reactions (planned, not yet applied): node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"CLICK\"},action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:\"<frameId>\",navigation:\"NAVIGATE\"}}]\n   - Retry-after-rate-limit works; cleanup loop at start of each retry removes stray nodes by name prefix (e.g., n.name.startsWith(\"07_Export\"))\n   - MCP Figma calls: one at a time, no parallel calls\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - FILE: S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU. Pages: 0:1 \"00 · Start Here\", 1:2 \"01 · Foundations\", 1:3 \"02 · Components\", 1:4 \"04 · Media\", 5:2 \"03 · Workspace\" (build target).\n   - GIVEN COMPONENTS: Button 3:24 (380×56, #612A74, r36, text prop \"Label#3:0\", default \"Login\"); Text Field 3:29 (380×56, white, stroke #D9D4CF, r16, text prop \"Placeholder#3:1\", default \"Email\"); Status Bar 3:34 (428×47, white fill, override instance fills per screen bg); Home Indicator 3:45 (428×34, place at y=894). Social logos: Google 4:42, Facebook 4:48 (multicolor — do NOT recolor). Avatar_Neutral 4:11 (rescale s/96).\n   - IMAGE HASHES: logo f8f9b5b3858b794701361638e2a43a34013ec18c; mug b33e106bff3f641b1402654e9d9d5ffdf2a99637; rat 69eb0235ba6c4ae0e2fade7e7cf9ee08b2857f0f; statue d6fed4696134f62100e5e107b55526d302491cde; student 13287f16160feaa047f4e410175f8eea38c72198; pdf ec7a1e4bdcb78b49dae4e3467913fb50db21088a.\n   - ICON COMPONENTS (stroke-based, recolor strokes+solid fills): 4:58 email, 4:64 password, 4:70 show, 4:76 plus, 4:82 search, 4:94 archive, 4:116 back, 4:128 edit, 4:134 copy, 4:139 share, 4:145 regen, 4:152 download, 4:157 send, 4:164 menu, 4:171 export, 4:177 close, 4:182 premium, 4:189 more, 4:197 del.\n   - Story_Text node 4:203 — characters fetched at runtime: `const story=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"4:203\")).characters; story.slice(0,460)` used for AI story bubble.\n   - CREATED SHARED COMPONENTS (in workspace, zone y≈3200): ViewSwitcher set 12:32 (variants \"View=Chats\" 12:11, \"View=Images\" 12:21, \"View=Exports\" 12:31; child tabs named \"tab/Chats\" etc.); Chat Item set 12:47 (variants \"Image=None\" 12:38, \"Image=With\" 12:46; children: question, preview, time, thumb); Export Row 12:53 (children: title, meta + pdf img); Image Tile 12:54 (116×116, r14, student image fill — override fills per tile); Suggestion Card 12:58 (title, detail); Settings Row 12:71 (children: rowicon [icon instance, swap via swapComponent], label, value, chev, note [hidden by default]); Bubble/User 12:74 (child msg, white text on primary); Bubble/AI 12:77 (child msg, dark text); Premium Badge 12:82; Header Home 12:106 (children: backBtn, avatar, title, newTopic, search); Header Chat 12:126 (children: menuBtn, exportBtn, logo, \"Chat Bot AI 4.5\", \"Premium account\").\n   - CREATED FRAMES so far: 01_Login = 13:23 (x0,y0): white bg, logo 92 @(168,128), \"Login to your account\" BR SemiBold 27, email TF filled \"sam.rivera@example.com\" dark text, password wrapper w/ TF \"••••••••\" + Icon_Show, Logi