d row: radio primary fill + inner white dot 8; label Medium text; others radio stroke border, fill surface... light mode radio: white fill + stroke border 2. Labels: \"Dark mode\", \"Light mode\", \"System default\" (selected). Rows in a V gap 0 h56 each, FILL width. Link: dim → 08.\n\nBuild both clones with dim + sheets. Position: 09 at x508 y2056, 10 at x1016 y2056.\n\nCareful with clone: f8.clone() clones children including statusbar etc. Rename \"09_Account_Actions_Sheet\", set x,y. PAGE.appendChild(clone) (clone lands on same page automatically? clone() adds to same parent as original — fine).\n\nFor cloning 08 — its settings rows include overrides; fine, it's the background.\n\nSheet 09 details:\n```\nconst sh9=V(\"sheet\",428,0,HEX.surface,[10,24,24,24],28); sh9.bottomLeftRadius=0; sh9.bottomRightRadius=0;\ngrabber\nrow s1=H FILL h56 gap12: IC arrow 4:121 20 primary; T(\"Sign out\",NU SemiBold,16,HEX.text); name \"link/signout\"\ndiv=rect 380×1 border (append, FILL width? rect resize(380,1))\nrow s2=H FILL h56 gap12: IC del 4:197 20 danger; T(\"Delete Account\",NU SemiBold,16,HEX.danger)\n```\ndanger color D93843 — add to HEX.\n\nSheet 10:\n```\nsh10=V(\"sheet\",428,0,HEX.surface,[10,24,24,24],28) top-only\ngrabber\ntitle T(\"Theme\",BR SemiBold,20,HEX.text) at padding; maybe row h48 with title.\noptions V gap0 FILL: 3 rows H FILL h56 gap14: radio circle + label.\nradio selected: ellipse/frame 22 r11 fill primary + inner white circle 8 centered (frame r11 + child circle). unselected: frame 22 r11 fill surface stroke border 2.\n```\nFor selected inner dot: create frame 22×22 cornerRadius 11, append ellipse 8×8 white at (7,7).\n\nTitle spacing: use V gap 8; after title add spacer? Simply: sheet V gap 10; grabber; title; options V(gap 0).\n\ny positions: sheet.y=928-sheet.height.\n\nAlso need ICONF-style IC() helper again — icons 4:121 (arrow up right) and 4:197 (delete). 4:121 isn't in my ICM map — add arrow:\"4:121\", del:\"4:197\".\n\nWrite the call: fix note