STANT\"}.\n\nWait but the branch that requires transition — which type does it correspond to? The order of branches: 1) CONDITIONAL, 2) BACK/CLOSE, 3) URL, 4-6) UPDATE_MEDIA_RUNTIME, 7) \"Expected action.transition to be one of the following...\" — this 7th branch is likely the NODE branch (type NODE with destinationId + navigation + required transition). Since the reported issues for branch 7 only mention transition, everything else matched.\n\nSo: {trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"INSTANT\"}}}.\n\nHmm — but \"Required value missing at [0].action.transition\" then nested \"Expected transition to be one of the following... Required value missing at [0].action.transition\" — weird nesting but essentially transition required. Try INSTANT; if fails, try {type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:0.2} or SMART_ANIMATE.\n\nTest on closeBtn first.","signature":"26f7b56db1494d64badeebd8"}],"id":"b80e66b2-8549-4097-b377-60d1246c332a","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cbd398f7-fd2c-4efa-bc91-7d5610c0ff98","uuid":"d87574b5-bca8-444c-ac09-adecf72ad97a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:17:55.107Z","thinking_duration_ms":11545}
