{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now clear. NODE action transition must be one of:\n- {type:\"DISSOLVE\"|\"SMART_ANIMATE\"|\"SCROLL_ANIMATE\", easing, duration}\n- {type:\"MOVE_IN\"|\"MOVE_OUT\"|\"PUSH\"|\"SLIDE_IN\"|\"SLIDE_OUT\", direction, matchLayers, easing, duration}\n\nFor app-like navigation, DISSOLVE with short duration or SMART_ANIMATE. Use {type:\"SMART_ANIMATE\",duration:0.3,easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}}? Easing format: {type:\"EASE_OUT\"} valid (Easing enum: LINEAR | EASE_IN | EASE_OUT | EASE_IN_OUT | EASE_IN_BACK etc. or {type:\"CUSTOM_BEZIER\"...}). Use easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}, duration:0.3.\n\nFor overlay-ish screens (07/09/10/12) a SLIDE_IN bottom would be nice but direction+matchLayers required; keep it simple: SMART_ANIMATE for all, or DISSOLVE. Use SMART_ANIMATE duration 0.3 EASE_OUT — matches mobile feel and is safe between frames with matching layers.\n\nTest then apply all 30 wires.","signature":"e611b3ce1a404e338591fdda"}],"id":"6cd2462f-8beb-4a04-b932-43ac112e6855","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cbd398f7-fd2c-4efa-bc91-7d5610c0ff98","uuid":"e92f7ef6-93ef-40bd-8fa8-ec61a61f6b30","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:18:18.029Z","thinking_duration_ms":4615}
