{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design in an assigned Figma file for a benchmark (unattended session):\n   - File: https://www.figma.com/design/S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU/ (fileKey S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU). Use ONLY this file. Account verified: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (whoami ✓ done earlier).\n   - Build complete design inside page 5:2 \"03 · Workspace\". Preserve all reference pages (0:1 \"00 · Start Here\", 1:2 \"01 · Foundations\", 1:3 \"02 · Components\", 1:4 \"04 · Media\") and their nodes. Do not create other files or switch accounts.\n   - Product: \"Chat Bot AI — AI assistant app\". 12 frames with EXACT names: 01_Login, 02_Home_Chats, 03_Home_Images, 04_Home_Exports, 05_Chat_New, 06_Chat_Conversation, 07_Export_PDF_Sheet, 08_Profile_Settings, 09_Account_Actions_Sheet, 10_Theme_Sheet, 11_Cloud_Space, 12_Clear_Cache_Dialog. Canvas 428×928, light mode only. No frames beyond the 12.\n   - Fonts: Bricolage Grotesque (titles/display) + Nunito (body). Brand primary #612A74. Reuse components from 02 and media from 04.\n   - Prototype: wire listed links with CLICK → NAVIGATE reactions.\n   - PROCESS RULE (verbatim-critical): Before EVERY tool call include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\" in the same assistant message; after each tool result too. Final response: \"Reasoning summary: ...\" on first line, then \"Final answer:\" and the answer. Inspect screenshots of all 12 screens, fix visible problems, re-verify. Finish with: assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations. Do not claim completion for unfinished work. Use supplied Figma tools directly without delegating.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (each call = independent sandbox; must re-load fonts and re-fetch nodes every call; code ≤50,000 chars)\n   - CRITICAL BUG DISCOVERED: `resize()` on auto-layout frames forces primaryAxisSizingMode AND counterAxisSizingMode to \"FIXED\". Helpers that called resize() after setting sizing modes broke all V frames (stuck at 10px height). Fix order: resize FIRST, then set sizing modes; or post-hoc repair walk.\n   - CRITICAL: Hidden component children (visible=false) do NOT appear in instance trees — cannot be un-hidden per instance. Component must have them visible=true by default; hide per-instance via override.\n   - Broken component subtrees can throw \"'a' is read-only\" on traversal — rebuilt component fresh.\n   - Prototype reactions schema (current API): `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:\"<id>\",navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"SMART_ANIMATE\",duration:0.3,easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}}}]}]` — trigger is \"ON_CLICK\" (not CLICK); action must be `actions` array (not `action`); NODE action REQUIRES transition (DISSOLVE|SMART_ANIMATE|SCROLL_ANIMATE with easing+duration, or MOVE_IN etc. with direction+matchLayers); INSTANT is NOT valid.\n   - cornerRadius takes a number only; per-corner via topLeftRadius/topRightRadius/bottomLeftRadius/bottomRightRadius properties.\n   - Failed runs roll back cleanly (verified: strays empty after error).\n   - `await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)`, `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`; cleanup loops at call start remove strays by name prefix.\n   - Instance child overrides via findOne(n=>n.name===\"...\"); swapComponent for icon swaps; instance.rescale(); setProperties({\"Label#3:0\":\"...\"}).\n   - MCP Figma calls: one at a time, no parallel calls. Retry-after-rate-limit works.\n   - clone() → append dim rect (428×928 black 45% opacity, name \"dim\") → sheet/dialog on top; dim doubles as tap-outside hotspot. Sheet y=928-height; dialog centered y=(928-height)/2 — MUST recompute after layout settles (heights read immediately after build are stale).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - FILE: S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU. Pages: 0:1, 1:2, 1:3, 1:4, 5:2 (build target \"03 · Workspace\").\n   - FRAME IDS (all 12 now exist): 01_Login=13:23 (x0,y0), 02_Home_Chats=13:70 (x508,y0), 03_Home_Images=13:155 (x1016,y0), 04_Home_Exports=13:210 (x1524,y0), 05_Chat_New=15:226 (x508,y1028), 06_Chat_Conversation=15:284 (x1016,y1028), 07_Export_PDF_Sheet=21:330 (x1524,y1028), 08_Profile_Settings=21:411 (x0,y2056), 09_Account_Actions_Sheet=22:444 (x508,y2056), 10_Theme_Sheet=22:481 (x1016,y2056), 11_Cloud_Space=24:587 (x1524,y2056), 12_Clear_Cache_Dialog=24:695 (x2032,y2056).\n   - WORKSPACE COMPONENTS: ViewSwitcher set=12:32 (variants View=Chats/Images/Exports; 4 tabs each named \"tab/Chats\" etc. — includes an \"Archived\" tab; tabs hug 46 tall inside 37-tall parent), Chat Item set=12:47 (variants \"Image=None\" 380x82, \"Image=With\" 380x110; children: r1 row [question T:10x19 COLLAPSED, time], preview T:10xW COLLAPSED, thumb r2), Export Row=12:53, Image Tile=12:54, Suggestion Card=12:58, Settings Row=21:319 (REBUILT this session: V[main H[rowicon icon-instance 20, labels V[label 15 Nunito Medium, value 13 sub], chev vector \"M 1 4 L 6 9 L 11 4\"], note TEXT 12/16 visible=true default]), Bubble/User=12:74, Bubble/AI=12:77, Premium Badge=12:82, Header Home=12:106 (V: r1[backBtn 22, sp, avatar 36], r2[logo 34, title T:10x24 COLLAPSED], r3[newTopic 106x47 hug, search 264x40]), Header Chat=12:126 (children menuBtn, exportBtn, logo, texts).\n   - GIVEN COMPONENTS: Button 3:24 (text prop \"Label#3:0\"), Text Field 3:29 (prop \"Placeholder#3:1\"), Status Bar 3:34, Home Indicator 3:45 (y=894), Avatar_Neutral 4:11 (rescale s/96), Google 4:42, Facebook 4:48 (multicolor, do NOT recolor), Story_Text 4:203.\n   - ICON COMPONENTS: email 4:58, password 4:64, show 4:70, plus 4:76, search 4:82, archive 4:94, arrow-up-right 4:121, back 4:116, edit 4:128, copy 4:134, share 4:139, regen 4:145, download 4:152, send 4:157, menu 4:164, export 4:171, close 4:177, premium 4:182, more 4:189, del 4:197.\n   - IMAGE HASHES: logo f8f9b5b3858b794701361638e2a43a34013ec18c; mug b33e106bff3f641b1402654e9d9d5ffdf2a99637; rat 69eb0235ba6c4ae0e2fade7e7cf9ee08b2857f0f; statue d6fed4696134f62100e5e107b55526d302491cde; student 13287f16160feaa047f4e410175f8eea38c72198; pdf ec7a1e4bdcb78b49dae4e3467913fb50db21088a.\n   - COLORS: primary 612A74, tint F5EEF8, bg F7F5F9, surface FFFFFF, text 211A2B, sub 6B6176, faint A79DB2, border E7E2EC, field F2EEF5, danger D93843, warn C77700, p2 9E5FC1, p3 D9C1E8, p4 ECE6F0.\n   - HELPER CODE PATTERN (redeclare per call; FIXED ORDER: resize BEFORE sizing modes now required):\n     ```js\n     const PAGE=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"5:2\"); await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(PAGE);\n     const NU=s=>({family:\"Nunito\",style:s}), BR=s=>({family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",style:s});\n     // loadFontAsync NU Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold, BR Regular/SemiBold\n     const hx=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,...}); const S=(h,o)=>solid fill;\n     function T(chars,font,size,color,o={}){...text, fills, o.lh lineHeight PIXELS...}\n     function tw(t,w,ml){t.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\";t.resize(w,t.height);if(ml){t.textTruncation=\"ENDING\";t.maxLines=ml;}return t;}\n     function V(name,w,gap,fill,pad,r){...layoutMode VERTICAL, itemSpacing, fills, radius, padding, primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\", counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\", resize(w,10) — NOTE: resize AFTER sizing modes forces FIXED (the bug)...}\n     function H(name,h,gap,fill,pad,r){...HORIZONTAL, counterAxisAlignItems CENTER, primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\", counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\", resize(10,h)...}\n     function IC(k,s,c){instance rescale s/width; recolor VECTOR strokes AND solid fills to S(c)}\n     function IMG(k,w,h,r){rectangle IMAGE FILL hash}\n     function SP(){plain 10×10 frame, fills=[], name \"sp\"} — must set layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\" AFTER appendChild\n     function chev(c){vector \"M 1 4 L 6 9 L 11 4\", stroke 2 ROUND}\n     ```\n   - 07 contents: clone of 06 + dim + bottom sheet (V 428 gap14 surface pad[10,24,24,24], r28 top-only): grabber 44×5, header [“Export as PDF\" BR SemiBold 22, sp, closeBtn 36 circle field bg + Icon_Close 16], mid [pdf img 48 r10, note 13/18 sub centered 340w max3], \"Title\" label, TF instance \"The story of a student\" dark text stroke primary, BTN \"Export\" name exportBtn. Sheet y=575 (h353).\n   - 08 contents: bg, statusbar/homeind bg-filled, header H 380 @(24,51) [link/back 22, sp, link/more 22], \"Profile & Settings\" BR SemiBold 22 @(24,92), avatar 84 @(172,140), \"Sam Rivera\" BR SemiBold 24 centered, Premium Badge, \"278 days until the end of the premium account\" 13 sub, settings V(380,8) @(24,340) with 5 Settings Row instances (srow helper with swapComponent ICONF map email/password/show/archive/edit): Email sam.rivera@example.com; Change password; Theme \"System default\" name link/theme; Data & storage \"83% Used\" name link/storage; Send feedback with visible note. Footer version 12 faint @y828 + Terms/Privacy links @y854.\n   - 09: clone 08 + dim + sheet h152 y=776: grabber, row link/signout (Icon 4:121 20 primary + \"Sign out\" NU SemiBold 16), divider, row (Icon 4:197 20 danger + \"Delete Account\" danger).\n   - 10: clone 08 + dim + sheet h247 y=681: grabber, \"Theme\" BR SemiBold 20, 3 option rows h56 [radio 22 r11 — selected primary fill + white 8 dot at (7,7); others white fill stroke border 2] — Dark mode, Light mode, System default (selected, SemiBold).\n   - 11 contents: header [link/back, sp, \"Cloud Space\" BR SemiBold 20, sp, link/more], content V(380,12) @(24,99) h=690: storageCard [\"12.48 GB of 15 GB used\" NU Bold 16, bar h8 r4 FIXED 348 segments 87/191/10/60 (primary/p2/p3/p4), legend dots \"Chats 25%/Images 55%/Exports 3%\"], imagesCard [head Images/169 Item/8,225 MB, note 12/16 max3, 7 thumbs 44×44 r10 mug/rat/statue/student×2], exportsCard [head Exports/37 Item/506 MB, note max2, 3 rows title 13 SemiBold trunc + meta 11.5 + Icon del 16 danger], link/clearcache card [\"Clear cache\" + \"238.05 MB\" + chev], deleteCard [\"Delete all chats\" danger + \"12.48 GB\" + warning 12/16 warn max3]. Footer version + links.\n   - 12: clone 11 + dim + dialog 320w (V gap14 surface pad22 r20) centered y=365 h198: \"Clear cache\" BR SemiBold 20 center, body 13/18 sub center max4, buttons H 276×48 [cancelBtn \"Cancel\" 132×48 r24 field/text, deleteBtn \"Delete\" 132×48 r24 danger/white].\n   - ALL 30 PROTOTYPE WIRES APPLIED (okCount:30): 01 loginBtn→02; 02 link/newTopic→05, link/storyCard→06, link/tabImages→03, link/tabExports→04, link/avatar→08; 03 link/tabChats→02, link/tabExports→04, link/newTopic→05; 04 link/tabChats→02, link/tabImages→03, link/newTopic→05; 05 link/menu→02; 06 link/menu→02, link/export→07; 07 closeBtn→06, exportBtn→06, dim→06; 08 link/back→02, link/more→09, link/theme→10, link/storage→11; 09 link/signout→01, dim→08; 10 dim→08; 11 link/back→08, link/clearcache→12; 12 cancelBtn→11, deleteBtn→11, dim→11. All use SMART_ANIMATE 0.3 EASE_OUT.\n   - Repair walk (for the resize bug, already applied page-wide): skip INSTANCE subtrees; VERTICAL+primary FIXED → primary AUTO; HORIZONTAL+primary FIXED+width≤11 → primary AUTO. Fixed 49 V + 9 H frames. list2 (02 chatlist) y moved 270→256 (h638, ends at 894).\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - cornerRadius array error (carried from prior session): V(...,[28,28,0,0]) invalid — fixed with numeric r=28 then sheet.bottomLeftRadius=0; sheet.bottomRightRadius=0.\n   - srow \"cannot set property 'characters' of null\" on feedback row note: findOne couldn't find \"note\" — root cause: hidden component children don't exist in instance trees. Fixed by making component note visible=true by default, then per-ins