User 12:74, Bubble/AI 12:77, Header Chat 12:126 for the same issue. Also check ViewSwitcher 12:32 tab overflow (tabs 46 tall in 37-tall variants).\n   - Re-screenshot 02 after fixes.\n   - Screenshot-verify remaining screens: 03 (13:155), 04 (13:210), 05 (15:226), 06 (15:284), 07 (21:330), 08 (21:411), 09 (22:444), 10 (22:481), 11 (24:587), 12 (24:695). Fix visible problems, re-verify.\n   - Final answer with: file URL https://www.figma.com/design/S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU/, page ID 5:2, all 12 frame IDs, prototype work summary (30 CLICK→NAVIGATE links with SMART_ANIMATE), remaining limitations.\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Screenshot-verifying all 12 screens. 01_Login (13:23) verified clean. 02_Home_Chats (13:70) showed broken chat items (question text truncated to 1 char, \"...\" instead of proper header content). Just completed a diagnostic dump of the three workspace components:\n   - Chat Item 12:47: variants 380x82/380x110 with r1 350x20 H p:FIXED/c:FIXED containing \"question\" T:10x19 and \"time\" T:61x15; r2 350x60 with \"preview\" T:10x51 and thumb 60x60 — question/preview texts collapsed to 10px width.\n   - Header Home 12:106: 428x138 V; r1 380x36 [backBtn, sp 302, avatar 36]; r2 380x34 [logo 34, title T:10x24 COLLAPSED]; r3 380x40 [newTopic 106x47 (47>40 overflow), search 264x40].\n   - ViewSwitcher 12:32: variants 380x37 with 4 hug tabs each 46 tall (overflow below the 37-tall bar).\n   The repair walk already fixed V-frame heights and narrow H rows, but these text nodes are 10px wide because they never received FILL width inside their FIXED rows (or their parents' widths don't propagate). The screenshot of 02 was the last tool result before this summary.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Fix the collapsed texts in the workspace components, then continue the screenshot pass. Direct continuation of: \"02 有明显问题：聊天项的问题文字宽度塌缩、头部图标异常。先检查相关组件(12:47/12:106 等)的内部结构与尺寸，定位塌缩根因。” — the dump is done; now in one use_figma call: (a) dump/fix Export Row 12:53, Suggestion Card 12