e = variant None's r1 was HUG-width so FILL collapsed to min 10; fixed by r1.layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\"+primaryAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; plus time had stale position — q.layoutPositioning=\"AUTO\"/t.layoutPositioning=\"AUTO\".\n   - Variant None question still 10 after r1 fix — fixed by re-setting q.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\" (refresh trick) then FILL → 281.\n   - 05 collapsed: sugrow H frames 12 tall, inputbar 10 wide, greet 20 tall (resize-bug aftermath) — fixed via explicit sizing-mode rebuild (see §3).\n   - 06 issues: messages overlapped header (y126→140), airow c:FIXED 20 clipped bubbles (→c:AUTO), awrap 34 wide clipped actions (→p:AUTO + paddingLeft 34 for AI rows), image sliver (→c:AUTO), inputbar collapsed (→380 rebuild), msgs overflow (img→150 then 100, msg1 maxLines 12→4, gap→8; final end 825 < 846 inputbar).\n   - msg1.maxLines=12 blew layout to end 1019 — reverted to 4 lines with ellipsis (visually acceptable).\n   - bc text width anomaly (654 in 236 frame) — fixed with textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\"+FILL+maxLines 3.\n   - 07 stale background (pre-repair 06 clone) — removed 3 stale children, re-cloned from repaired 15:284 below dim.\n   - 08 collapsed settings rows — Settings Row component hug chain (main 70, labels 16) fixed with FILL chain (main 380, labels 326).\n   - ViewSwitcher h:54 too tall after c:AUTO — set tab paddingTop/Bottom=8 → 42.\n   - Persistent Figma MCP rate limits — retry identical call; also switched to enableBase64Response=true for screenshots.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Diagnosed the full FILL-in-hug collapse chain and repaired 6 components + 4 frames.\n   - Established screenshot verification loop: 01 ✓ (prior session), 02 ✓, 03 ✓, 04 ✓, 05 ✓, 06 ✓, 07 ✓, 08 ✓, 09 ✓ (last screenshot shows correct dimmed 08 background + Sign out/Delete Account sheet — visually clean).\n   - Budget rule: content must end above y=894 (home indicator) and overlays flush to 928.\n   - Known pattern: 09/10 backgrounds auto-updated via component instances; 12's background is a static clone of 11 — if 11 needs structural fixes, 12 will need the same re-clone treatment as 07.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Initial task (Chinese, from first session): “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计：Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。”\n   - Benchmark framing constraints: assigned file only; verify account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing; read 00/01 pages; reuse 02 components and 04 media; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; build in 03 · Workspace; do not create a different Figma file or switch accounts/teams; use supplied Figma tools directly without delegating to other agents; \"Reasoning summary:\" prefix before every tool call and in the final answer; screenshot-verify all screens; unattended session — resolve routine choices from the brief, report real limitations if blocked; finish with file URL, page ID, screen IDs, prototype work, limitations; do not claim completion for unfinished work.\n   - This session contained only the continuation summary + system reminders (no new user-role messages).\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Screenshot-verify 10_Theme_Sheet (22:481), 11_Cloud_Space (24:587), 12_Clear_Cache_Dialog (24:695). Fix any visible problems (12 may need re-clone of 11 background if 11 is repaired; 10's background auto-updated via instances but verify).\n   - Optionally re-confirm 09 (22:444) verdict — last screenshot looked clean.\n   - Write final response: \"Reasoning summary:\" line then \"Final answer:\" containing: file URL https://www.figma.com/design/S5iN4noHDacG8jTW5ILkwU/, page ID 5:2, all 12 frame IDs (13:23, 13:70, 13:155, 13:210, 15:226, 15:284, 21:330, 21:411, 22:444, 22:481, 24:587, 24:695), prototype summary (30 CLICK→NAVIGATE wires with SMART_ANIMATE 0.3 EASE_OUT, all applied), and remaining limitations (e.g., 06 first AI bubble truncated at 4 lines with