r. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cbd398f7-fd2c-4efa-bc91-7d5610c0ff98","uuid":"682a05ac-5b9b-444c-8292-72bd2b3ce9b9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T23:00:37.818Z","isSynthetic":true}
